## Members

The Expert Group on Funding for Early Learning and Care and School Age Childcare is made up of representatives from across the Early Learning and Care and School Age Childcare sector. The group includes:

- representatives from the Early Learning and Care and School Age Childcare sector;
- representatives from the Department of Children, Equality, Disability, Integration and Youth;
- representatives from the Department of Finance;
- representatives from the National Economic and Social Council;
- representatives from the Department of Public Expenditure and Reform;
- representatives from the Department of Education;
- representatives from the Department of Health;
- representatives from the Department of Social Protection;
- representatives from the Department of Housing, Local Government and Heritage;
- representatives from the Department of Enterprise, Trade and Employment; and
- independent experts.

